1
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:15,370
Corvax! What's your surprise?

2
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:18,769
-What's your secret? -My secret?

3
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:20,883
Ah! Wait a moment.

4
00:00:21,359 --> 00:00:24,442
Look outside! Is anyone there?

5
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:28,888
Is anyone there?

6
00:00:29,079 --> 00:00:30,490
No!

7
00:00:31,839 --> 00:00:34,682
Thimbo... Is anyone there?

8
00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:36,921
Can you see anyone?

9
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:38,600
Oh!

10
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:44,441
I can't see anyone.

11
00:00:45,159 --> 00:00:47,240
No. There's no one outside.

12
00:00:57,679 --> 00:00:59,328
Help!

13
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:02,081
Help!

14
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:05,281
Help!

15
00:01:08,719 --> 00:01:10,800
Help!

16
00:01:10,959 --> 00:01:14,520
There's someone inside. Listen!

17
00:01:15,079 --> 00:01:17,320
I can't hear anyone.

18
00:01:17,560 --> 00:01:20,131
Help!

19
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:24,449
Ah! Now I can hear someone.

20
00:01:28,920 --> 00:01:31,081
Oh! Thank you.

21
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:34,285
Is there anyone inside now?

22
00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:37,160
No. There's no one inside.

23
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:39,927
And your clock's working.

24
00:01:42,079 --> 00:01:44,080
No one there?

25
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:45,845
Right!

26
00:01:46,079 --> 00:01:47,728
Take this box!

27
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:49,331
OK, I've got it.

28
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:53,043
Now, push the button!

29
00:01:53,480 --> 00:01:54,891
This button?

30
00:01:55,079 --> 00:01:59,846
No! That's the wrong one, stupid!

31
00:02:00,079 --> 00:02:01,319
Look!

32
00:02:01,519 --> 00:02:03,567
It says 'Push'.

33
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:09,930
Oh, you can't read. Look!

34
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:12,681
Push this button here!

35
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:14,971
Ah!

36
00:02:17,599 --> 00:02:19,407
Good! That's right!

37
00:02:19,599 --> 00:02:21,488
Now you're invisible.

38
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:23,921
Can anyone see me?

39
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:28,526
No. You're invisible.

40
00:02:29,039 --> 00:02:32,087
Wow! I'm invisible!

41
00:02:32,479 --> 00:02:34,720
No one can see me!

42
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:38,047
Now I'm pushing my button.

43
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:44,810
Now you're invisible, too.

44
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:47,446
Yes. That's my secret.

45
00:02:47,639 --> 00:02:49,767
IN-VI-SI-BLE!

46
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:51,411
Wheee!

47
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:56,328
Put those clocks down!

48
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:58,090
And do some work!

49
00:02:58,479 --> 00:03:00,959
Put some roses on the cake!

50
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:06,566
A red one here...

51
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:10,287
A yellow one here...

52
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:16,328
A yellow one...

53
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:20,682
What about a big one on the top?

54
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:24,925
I'm putting this on the top.

55
00:03:25,319 --> 00:03:28,323
There! Now it's ready.

56
00:03:30,719 --> 00:03:33,881
Ohh! It's lovely!

57
00:03:35,319 --> 00:03:36,843
Don't be silly!

58
00:03:39,159 --> 00:03:40,445
It's half past four.

59
00:03:40,639 --> 00:03:44,360
The queen's waiting for you. Off you go!

60
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:55,168
Now, can you greet the guests politely?

61
00:03:55,439 --> 00:03:57,088
Yes, your Majesty.

62
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:00,566
Wait!

63
00:04:04,319 --> 00:04:08,403
All right. Say 'Good evening'.

64
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:10,721
'Ello, darling!

65
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:14,569
No, no, no! That's rude.

66
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:18,567
Say 'Good evening' politely.

67
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:20,524
Like this.

68
00:04:20,759 --> 00:04:22,602
'Good evening'.

69
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:25,930
Good evening, your Majesty.

70
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:28,443
That's better.

71
00:04:28,639 --> 00:04:30,084
What do I do now?

72
00:04:30,639 --> 00:04:32,050
Take my coat.

73
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:35,365
No! Take it carefully.

74
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:40,290
Now put it down.

75
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:42,720
No!

76
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:44,921
Put it down gently.

77
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:49,370
Right!

78
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:52,608
Now open the other door.

79
00:04:53,959 --> 00:04:55,404
No, no!

80
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:57,165
Close it again,

81
00:04:57,360 --> 00:05:01,046
and then open it gently and quietly.

82
00:05:01,639 --> 00:05:03,288
Like this?

83
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:05,490
That's right...

84
00:05:07,639 --> 00:05:10,482
You aren't very good at this.

85
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:22,005
We're ready for the party.

86
00:05:22,639 --> 00:05:24,960
Everyone's coming along.

87
00:05:26,319 --> 00:05:28,400
We're ready for the party.

88
00:05:28,920 --> 00:05:31,400
So let's all sing a song.

89
00:05:32,639 --> 00:05:34,640
There are peanuts and crisps.

90
00:05:35,639 --> 00:05:37,960
And biscuits and buns.

91
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:40,561
-Lemonade. -And orange juice.

92
00:05:40,759 --> 00:05:42,249
Pizzas and pies.

93
00:05:44,439 --> 00:05:47,966
And a great big huge enormous cake!

94
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:50,886
And I've got my big surprise!

95
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:54,161
What about chocolate or strawberry ice?

96
00:05:54,839 --> 00:05:57,524
Would you like some spaghetti or rice?

97
00:05:57,920 --> 00:06:00,570
Have a biscuit! Have a bun!

98
00:06:00,879 --> 00:06:03,450
Here are some peanuts! Let's have fun!

99
00:06:04,639 --> 00:06:06,129
I'm having clocks.

100
00:06:07,319 --> 00:06:09,287
They're very nice.

101
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:11,843
I'm eating them all.

102
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:15,686
And I don't want a piece...

103
00:06:16,199 --> 00:06:19,566
of the great big huge enormous cake!

104
00:06:19,759 --> 00:06:22,364
But wait for my big surprise!

105
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:26,283
Would you like some cheese?

106
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:28,050
I'm having some.

107
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:30,481
Oh! Yes, please.

108
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:34,408
-How much? -A little, please.

109
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:36,443
That's lovely.

110
00:06:37,720 --> 00:06:41,281
Would you like some cake? It's very nice.

111
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:43,163
Oh! Yes, please.

112
00:06:43,399 --> 00:06:45,242
Here's a piece of cake.

113
00:06:45,519 --> 00:06:48,362
I'm having a piece, too.

114
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:54,002
-Have a piece of this. -No, thank you.

115
00:06:54,319 --> 00:06:58,210
-Would you like some soup? -No, not for me, thank you.

116
00:06:58,839 --> 00:07:02,843
A bun -some biscuits- a cup of tea?

117
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:06,722
-A glass of lemonade? -No, thank you very much.

118
00:07:06,959 --> 00:07:10,246
I like clocks. Lots of clocks.

119
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:14,485
A cup.

120
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:17,043
Some tea.

121
00:07:17,879 --> 00:07:19,722
A cup of tea.

122
00:07:20,439 --> 00:07:21,564
Some soup.

123
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:24,403
A little soup.

124
00:07:26,639 --> 00:07:28,767
A lot of soup.

125
00:07:30,279 --> 00:07:31,609
A clock.

126
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:33,569
Some clocks.

127
00:07:35,879 --> 00:07:38,007
Lots of clocks.

128
00:07:43,399 --> 00:07:46,209
And now! Here's Amanda!

129
00:07:56,839 --> 00:07:59,604
Ohh! What a lovely baby!

130
00:08:01,879 --> 00:08:02,925
No!

131
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:04,166
Don't!

132
00:08:04,399 --> 00:08:06,879
What's happening? Where's Amanda going?

133
00:08:17,519 --> 00:08:19,487
What's happening?

134
00:08:20,639 --> 00:08:23,039
Someone's opening the door.

135
00:08:24,519 --> 00:08:25,759
Look!

136
00:08:26,439 --> 00:08:27,929
There's Amanda!

137
00:08:29,199 --> 00:08:31,679
She's going that way.

138
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:35,130
Now someone's opening the other door.

139
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:40,120
Now she's going through that door.

140
00:08:40,639 --> 00:08:42,880
And someone's closing it.

141
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:46,003
Closing it.

142
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:49,360
Where's Amanda?

143
00:08:49,559 --> 00:08:53,358
-What happened? -Someone opened that door.

144
00:08:53,559 --> 00:08:57,200
Then someone opened the other door.

145
00:08:57,639 --> 00:08:59,243
And someone closed it.

146
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:02,805
-Closed it. -But where's Amanda?

147
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:05,123
She went through that door.

148
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:06,844
She went that way.

149
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:09,441
-She... -Oh, come on!

150
00:09:09,639 --> 00:09:11,050
They can't help.

151
00:09:12,519 --> 00:09:14,886
She went that way.

152
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:17,810
She went through that door.

153
00:09:23,799 --> 00:09:25,448
What's the matter?

154
00:09:25,679 --> 00:09:27,362
Your clock's wrong.

155
00:09:27,559 --> 00:09:28,764
Oh dear!

156
00:09:29,399 --> 00:09:31,924
Yes. It is wrong.

157
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:37,005
-What's he doing? -He's listening...

158
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:40,446
Now he's looking at the clock...

159
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:44,121
Now he's opening the door...

160
00:09:45,519 --> 00:09:47,680
He's going inside...

161
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:49,849
Now he's closing the door.

162
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:53,881
He's going upstairs.

163
00:09:58,559 --> 00:10:00,448
It's all right now.

164
00:10:25,559 --> 00:10:27,765
Now, sir. What happened?

165
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:31,247
Well, I listened to the clock.

166
00:10:31,679 --> 00:10:33,328
Then I looked at it.

167
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:36,169
I opened the door.

168
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:37,771
Then I closed it.

169
00:10:38,919 --> 00:10:40,489
I went upstairs...

170
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:42,449
And the clock was all right.

171
00:10:42,639 --> 00:10:44,084
It was all right.

172
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:47,569
Well, it isn't all right now.

173
00:10:57,279 --> 00:11:00,761
I pushed the button. I was invisible.

174
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:03,201
And... what do I do now?

175
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:05,728
Get into the boat.

176
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:08,205
This one?

177
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:10,801
No! That's an old boat.

178
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:12,764
Get into the one over there!

179
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:14,849
The new one.

180
00:11:15,039 --> 00:11:16,928
The big new boat?

181
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:20,329
-The King's boat? -Yes.

182
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:23,925
The baby's things are in there.

183
00:11:24,240 --> 00:11:25,480
And take the baby!

184
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:27,891
I've got her.

185
00:11:28,080 --> 00:11:30,401
Ow! This baby bites.

186
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:33,001
-What's the matter? -She bit me.

187
00:11:33,240 --> 00:11:34,401
What?

188
00:11:35,279 --> 00:11:37,122
The baby bit me. Ow!

189
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:41,487
She bit me again.

190
00:11:41,679 --> 00:11:43,283
She often bites.

191
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:46,840
Where are the things for the baby?

192
00:11:47,200 --> 00:11:48,849
We've got these things here.

193
00:11:49,039 --> 00:11:52,248
A pair of shoes, a pair of socks...

194
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:54,363
It's all right. We've got everything.

195
00:11:54,679 --> 00:11:56,328
Let's

196
00:12:04,879 --> 00:12:06,802
We looked everywhere.

197
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:10,368
We looked everywhere.

198
00:12:12,279 --> 00:12:13,724
In the garden?

199
00:12:13,919 --> 00:12:15,842
We looked in the garden.

200
00:12:16,039 --> 00:12:17,369
In the kitchen?

201
00:12:17,559 --> 00:12:19,163
We looked in the kitchen.

202
00:12:19,480 --> 00:12:20,891
In the bedrooms?

203
00:12:21,080 --> 00:12:22,809
We looked in the bedrooms.

204
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:26,083
We looked in the garden. We looked in the kitchen.

205
00:12:26,279 --> 00:12:28,122
We looked in the bedrooms.

206
00:12:28,399 --> 00:12:30,640
We can't find Amanda anywhere.

207
00:12:30,879 --> 00:12:31,879
Where is Amanda?

208
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:34,730
We don't know.

209
00:12:37,559 --> 00:12:41,166
We looked and we listened. We opened the doors.

210
00:12:41,440 --> 00:12:44,967
We opened the windows. We looked on the ﬂoors.

211
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:47,209
Where is Amanda?

212
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:51,886
We don't know.

213
00:13:00,399 --> 00:13:02,400
Wait a moment! Where's Corvax?

214
00:13:02,679 --> 00:13:04,885
-He was here. -But he isn't here now.

215
00:13:05,080 --> 00:13:08,607
No. And... what's his name? Thimbo.

216
00:13:08,799 --> 00:13:11,166
-He was here, but... -He isn't here now.

217
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:13,328
They've got Amanda. Quick!

218
00:13:13,639 --> 00:13:14,925
Find them!

